From: Celeste Whitford <celeste.whitford@whitford-family.example>
To: Tax preparation <tax@finance-demo.example>
Subject: Whitford 2025 Form 1040 documents
Date: Fri, 20 Feb 2026 08:40:00 -0800
Message-ID: <WHITFORD-2025-1040@whitford-family.example>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary="=_WHITFORD_2025_1040_records"

--=_WHITFORD_2025_1040_records
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hi,

Attached are our 2025 Forms W-2, the Forms 1099 and our mortgage papers. The =
organizer, last year's return summary, the tax and gift spreadsheets, the est=
imated payment log and the HANGS letter are in the shared folder. Please prep=
are our 2025 Form 1040.

A few things:

- We refinanced in June. The new lender sent a 1098; the old one never did, s=
o we used the payoff statement.
- The Children's Hospital Foundation has not sent the receipt letter for our =
September gift yet.
- Our IRS online account shows only three of our four estimated payments for =
2025. The January one says 2026.
- Celeste's bonus was paid in January, so it is not on her 2025 W-2.

Thanks,
Celeste Whitford

--=_WHITFORD_2025_1040_records
Content-Type: application/pdf
Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64
Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="2025 Forms W-2.pdf"
